{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"43":"General Behavior (Kitab Al-Adab)"},"section_detail":{"43":{"hadithnumber_first":4773,"hadithnumber_last":5274,"arabicnumber_first":4773,"arabicnumber_last":5274,"name_native":"كتاب الآداب"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4858,"arabicnumber":4858,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن صالح، حدثنا ابن وهب، قال قال عمرو وحدثني بنحو، ذلك عبد الرحمن بن ابي عمرو عن المقبري، عن ابي هريرة، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم مثله","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":43,"hadith":86}}]}